==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~8.33 seconds<sup>150f~250f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*4 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Gudebene Cat (Enemy)|Gudebene Cat]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a fairly simple stage, the only threat is Gudebene Cat. [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area-Attacking Cats]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can easily beat this stage.

